  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Jordan&#x2019;s Private-Public Partnership Unit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Growth Gateway will provide technical assistance to Jordan&apos;s PPP Unit to: 

1)	Strengthen the Unit&#x2019;s operating strategy and capacity to implement PPPs;
2)	Establish a credible pipeline of high potential PPP projects across several sectors that have high development impact and potential to attract FDI;
3)	Identify, categorise and mobilise investors and support the Unit&#x2019;s engagement with potential investors on 2-3 priority projects.</narrative>
  </description>
